fdp-server
==========

This product includes the following third-party data.

IP geolocation database (DB-IP IP-to-City Lite)
-----------------------------------------------
IP geolocation by DB-IP — https://db-ip.com

The bundled GeoLite2-City.mmdb is the DB-IP "IP to City Lite" database,
distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution to DB-IP (https://db-ip.com) is required wherever this data, or
results derived from it, are distributed or displayed. The metrics dashboard
surfaces this attribution in its footer; keep it in place.

The database is fetched by scripts/fetch-geoip.sh and bundled into the Docker
image at build time (see Dockerfile, DBIP_CITY_VERSION). It is not vendored in
source control.
